 "statement": {
  "status": "present",
  "value": "Inferred log record shape [time, userId, action] with action ADD or REMOVE; records are in non-decreasing time order and later records win ties. Replaying the log: ADD of an inactive user makes them an active moderator whose rank is the position of that ADD record; ADD of an already-active user is a no-op (keeps the earlier rank); REMOVE of an active user deactivates them; REMOVE of an inactive user is a no-op. An earlier rank is a higher level. canRemove(actor, target) is true iff both are active, actor != target and actor ranks strictly higher than target (state after the whole log).",
  "provenance": [
   {
    "repository": "gamma",
    "revision": null,
    "path": "projects/algorithm_solver/catalogue/authored/hack2hire-chunk02-d-20261028-v1/contracts.json",
